00:12:46.788 --> 00:12:51.720
Bill Gates: They’re faced with an almost&nbsp;
impossible problem. Northern Nigeria,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:51.720 --> 00:12:57.840
Yemen, Chad. And so, what we need to&nbsp;
