00:13:03.360 --> 00:13:09.240
space birthing, or -or have a smaller family&nbsp;
size, and improve health. Because it’s,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:09.240 --> 00:13:15.420
amazingly as children survive, parents feel&nbsp;
