less children. https://youtu.be/ozlbeXrb_5A?t=57

00:13:19.889 --> 00:13:23.040
GITHONGO: You know, Bill Gates&nbsp;
talks about it a lot and all that,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:23.040 --> 00:13:28.320
that really irritates Africans. I mean,&nbsp;
okay, very clever guy, very good hearted guy,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:28.320 --> 00:13:31.500
he wants to do the right thing. But this&nbsp;
is really none of his business about the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:31.500 --> 00:13:35.280
population. We have, we have enough space.&nbsp;
Our problem is not population in Africa,&nbsp;&nbsp;

