00:13:39.500 --> 00:13:46.740
GAVIN: When I think about all the challenges kind&nbsp;
of inherent in the demographics of the continent,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:46.740 --> 00:13:51.360
I don't think that bringing birth rates down&nbsp;
