like they were very much putting it&nbsp;
into these very specific categories,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:01.500 --> 00:16:05.040
a blessing or a curse. Do you think you&nbsp;
could sort of break that down for me?

00:16:05.040 --> 00:16:11.400
GAVIN: It does tend to be this really binary&nbsp;
read on this. So there's a school of thought&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:11.400 --> 00:16:18.000
that suggests that, all these young people&nbsp;
